== Behavior ==
{{Sectionstub}}
The '''Manticore''' mainly attacks using contact damage with its high speed.

Occasionally{{Confirm}}, the '''Manticore''' uses its {{DarkGreen|'''Fatal Sting'''}} attack. {{Green|Green}} particles are emitted from the '''Manticore''''s head for a few seconds before shooting a barrage of arrows at the player. If any arrows hit a player, this deals immense damage to the player, disables all healing effects, and starts a timer, requiring the player to defeat the '''Manticore''' before the timer runs out. Failing to do so instantly kills the player. This attack can be dodged with enough speed and distance. When a player is hit, the following dialogue appears in chat:

{{Dialogue|&2&lFATAL STING! &cYou were fatally stung by a &5Manticore&c! Kill it before the time runs out or &c&ldie!}}

Attempting to heal after getting hit causes the following dialogue to appear in chat:

{{Dialogue|&cThe &2Fatal Sting &cof the &5Manticore &cdisabled all healing!}}

The '''Manticore''' is immune to the stunning effect of {{Item|Fire Freeze Staff}}.

